tip: | Look at the leaf. | Dark green here is bluer than mid green, and light green is yellower. The color changes as well as the brightness.
tip: 3 | Follow one ramp. | The Greens ramp is built that way: each step down moves toward blue and each step up toward yellow. Shading along it gives the hue shift for free.
tip: | Try it. | Tap a dark pixel with the Color picker, then a light one, and watch the hue slider move. Lit and shaded greens are different hues. | picker
